# ===========================================
# NOTES - Packages requiring special installation:
# ===========================================
# These are handled by run_once_before_install-package-manager.sh.tmpl:
# - fish (via PPA: ppa:fish-shell/release-3)
# - starship (via curl installer)
# - uv (via curl installer)
# - eza (via GitHub release download)
# - lazygit (via GitHub release download)
# - git-delta (via GitHub release download)
# - chezmoi (via curl installer)
# - yazi (via GitHub release download)
#
# Python tools (install via uv tool after setup):
# - poetry, black, ruff, pyright, etc.
#
# Node.js tools (install via npm after installing node):
# - typescript-language-server, prettier, biome, etc.
